    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a MORE UPCOMING GAMES! \ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.poster.avif?t=1754640354\" width=800 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.webm?t=1754640354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you're good at spotting images and solving captchas? Join Doma, a curious little cat who's just started training to become a detective! Help Doma take on picture-matching challenges from his senior detectives and prove your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game, simple and quick gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 photo categories to explore, with 9 fun photos in each one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a challenge? Try the black &amp; white mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastered all the photos? Test your speed in timer mode and set a new record!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you're good at spotting images and solving captchas? Join Doma, a curious little cat who's just started training to become a detective! Help Doma take on picture-matching challenges from his senior detectives and prove your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game, simple and quick gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 photo categories to explore, with 9 fun photos in each one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a challenge? Try the black &amp; white mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastered all the photos? Test your speed in timer mode and set a new record!</p></li></ul>",
